  "slug": "bar-service-inventory-log-form",
  "title": "Bar Service Inventory Log Form",
  "subtitle": "Reconcile beverage stock through receipt, controlled issue, transfer, return, waste, closing count, variance review, and custody handoff.",
  "description": "An original beverage inventory and custody log for event bar operations. It links ordered product to lot or package identifiers, opening counts, station issues and transfers, returns, observed waste or breakage, closing counts, unexplained variances, and responsible review.",
  "use_case": "Use for the product scope covered by one bar service order. Record movements when custody changes, use a continuation when more rows are required, and close only when counted quantities reconcile or every variance has an owner, review status, and final disposition.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
